# Wing Component Builder

Use this skill when the user asks to build, modify, or debug a wing — CMO (Marketing), CRO (Sales/Revenue), COO (Operations), or CFO (Finance).

## Wing structure (canonical)

Each wing has 3 layers:
1. **Wing core** — the depth-1 panel that opens when the wing is selected
2. **Sub-tool tiles** — the 3-4 sub-tools in this wing, tiled around the core
3. **Sub-tool runtime** — depth-2 fullscreen views, one per sub-tool

## File pattern (use for every wing)

```
src/components/wings/CmoWing.tsx          # Wing panel (depth 1)
src/components/tools/cmo/
  ├── InstagramCreator.tsx                # Depth 2 fullscreen
  ├── LinkedInPost.tsx
  ├── ArticleCanvas.tsx
  └── VideoGenerator.tsx
src/app/api/cmo/
  ├── instagram/route.ts                  # Live API endpoint
  ├── linkedin/route.ts
  ├── article/route.ts
  └── video/route.ts
```

## The wing component template

```tsx
// src/components/wings/CmoWing.tsx
"use client";
import { motion } from "motion/react";
import { FrameSVGOctagon } from "@arwes/react";
import { useSelector } from "@xstate/react";
import { stageActor } from "@/lib/machine";
import { InstagramCreator } from "@/components/tools/cmo/InstagramCreator";
import { LinkedInPost } from "@/components/tools/cmo/LinkedInPost";
import { ArticleCanvas } from "@/components/tools/cmo/ArticleCanvas";
import { VideoGenerator } from "@/components/tools/cmo/VideoGenerator";

const tools = [
  { id: "instagram", label: "INSTAGRAM",       icon: "/lottie/cmo-ig.lottie",        component: InstagramCreator },
  { id: "linkedin",  label: "LINKEDIN",        icon: "/lottie/cmo-linkedin.lottie",  component: LinkedInPost },
  { id: "article",   label: "ARTICLE+IMAGES",  icon: "/lottie/cmo-article.lottie",   component: ArticleCanvas },
  { id: "video",     label: "VIDEO",           icon: "/lottie/cmo-video.lottie",     component: VideoGenerator },
];

export function CmoWing() {
  const activeTool = useSelector(stageActor, (s) => s.context.activeTool);
  const ActiveComponent = tools.find(t => t.id === activeTool)?.component;

  if (activeTool && ActiveComponent) {
    return (
      <motion.div
        layoutId={`tool-${activeTool}`}
        className="fixed inset-0 z-50"
        transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}
      >
        <ActiveComponent />
      </motion.div>
    );
  }

  return (
    <motion.div
      layoutId="wing-cmo"
      className="fixed inset-0 z-40 flex items-center justify-center"
      transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}
    >
      <FrameSVGOctagon
        style={{ '--arwes-frames-line-color': '#00d4ff' } as any}
        className="w-[90vw] h-[80vh]"
      />
      <div className="absolute inset-0 grid grid-cols-2 grid-rows-2 gap-8 p-16">
        {tools.map(tool => (
          <motion.button
            key={tool.id}
            layoutId={`tool-${tool.id}`}
            onClick={() => stageActor.send({ type: "RUN_TOOL", toolId: tool.id })}
            className="border border-cyan-400/40 bg-black/60 hover:bg-cyan-950/40 transition-all"
          >
            <h2 className="text-6xl font-bold text-cyan-100">{tool.label}</h2>
          </motion.button>
        ))}
      </div>
    </motion.div>
  );
}
```

## Wing-specific configurations

| Wing | Color accent | Sub-tools | Skill backing |
|---|---|---|---|
| **CMO (Marketing)** | Cyan `#00d4ff` | Instagram · LinkedIn · Article+Images · Video | `ai-cmo`, `caption-writer` |
| **CRO (Sales/Revenue)** | Amber `#ffa500` | Lead Scraper · Cold Email · Call Script · Follow-up | `ai-cro`, `cold-outreach-sequence` |
| **COO (Operations)** | Cyan-violet `#7eccff` | Weekly Focus · Daily 3-Priority · Process Auditor | `ai-coo`, `purely-personal:operations-engine` |
| **CFO (Finance)** | Amber-gold `#ffcc44` | Cash Forecast · Pricing Optimizer · P&L Snapshot | `ai-cfo`, `purely-personal:cash-engine` |

## The CFO surprise reveal (Act 3 only)

CFO wing stays HIDDEN through Acts 1 and 2. In code:
```tsx
const [cfoRevealed, setCfoRevealed] = useState(false);
// Triggered only when XState enters the act3 superstate
```

When Act 3 begins, CFO wing illuminates **for the first time**. Audience reacts: "wait, there's a 4th one?" That moment is the dramatic gold.

## Acceptance criteria for each wing
- [ ] Layout passes the 50ft test (body 64pt, headlines 96-128pt)
- [ ] Wing opens with smooth layoutId morph from depth 0 → 1
- [ ] Each sub-tool opens fullscreen with layoutId morph from depth 1 → 2
- [ ] Esc returns from sub-tool → wing → idle
- [ ] All 3 modes (live/fake/safe) work for every sub-tool
- [ ] Wing-color accent applied to chrome (don't break the cyan/amber rule)
- [ ] Movie-reference test: every visible element traces to Iron Man / Tron / Blade Runner / Mission Impossible / Apple Vision Pro
